Note on bundled third-party material
------------------------------------

The `附件/` directory contains `usbmmidd_v2`, a third-party virtual display
driver for Windows Server, redistributed here for convenience alongside its
usage instructions. It is **not** covered by the MIT license above; it remains
the property of its original author and is subject to that author's own terms.
See https://blog.csdn.net/toooooop8/article/details/158696996 for the original
distribution.

CROPWAT 8.0 itself is developed and distributed free of charge by the
**Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations (FAO)**. It is not
included in this repository; obtain it from FAO's official channels.
